{"story":{"id":"event-fircon-1495","title":{"zh":"推进力学支持者宣言","en":"Propulsion Proponent Proclamation"},"category":"society","kind":"event","image":"art/93d760556454abd590b7.webp","start":"fircon.1500","chapters":5,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"我们收到了报告，是关于在[pre_ftl_planet.GetName]上进行超光速航天器推进装置的事项。当地居民似乎打算成为一个彻底的太空文明。然而，他们在星空中发现的东西，可能会证明当下阶段他们还无法理解。","en":"We have received reports of superluminal spacecraft propulsion on [pre_ftl_planet.GetName]. The inhabitants seem intent on becoming a full-fledged spacefaring civilization. What they discover in the stars may prove too much for them to comprehend."},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"fircon.1500","parent":"n0","via":{"hooks":["immediate"],"kind":"entry","source":"events/first_contact_dlc_events.txt:4273","triggers":[{"zh":"由游戏状态触发","en":"Triggered by game state"}]},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"fircon.1505","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"FASCINATING","optionIndex":0,"delay":[{"days":"500"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/first_contact_dlc_events.txt:4318"},"children":["n3","n4","n5","n6"]},"n3":{"doc":"fircon.1510","parent":"n2","via":{"option":"fircon.1505.a","optionIndex":0,"delay":[{"days":"1000"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/first_contact_dlc_events.txt:4414"},"children":[]},"n4":{"ref":"n3","doc":"fircon.1510","parent":"n2","via":{"option":"fircon.1505.b","optionIndex":1,"delay":[{"days":"1000"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/first_contact_dlc_events.txt:4439"}},"n5":{"doc":"fircon.1515","parent":"n2","via":{"option":"fircon.1505.c","optionIndex":2,"delay":[{"days":"1000"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/first_contact_dlc_events.txt:4464"},"children":["n7"]},"n6":{"ref":"n5","doc":"fircon.1515","parent":"n2","via":{"option":"fircon.1505.d","optionIndex":3,"delay":[{"days":"1000"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/first_contact_dlc_events.txt:4476"}},"n7":{"doc":"fircon.1520","parent":"n5","via":{"option":"fircon.1515.a","optionIndex":0,"delay":[{"days":"1000"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/first_contact_dlc_events.txt:4563"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"fircon.1500","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"推进力学支持者宣言","en":"Propulsion Proponent Proclamation"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们收到了报告，是关于在[pre_ftl_planet.GetName]上进行超光速航天器推进装置的事项。当地居民似乎打算成为一个彻底的太空文明。然而，他们在星空中发现的东西，可能会证明当下阶段他们还无法理解。","en":"We have received reports of superluminal spacecraft propulsion on [pre_ftl_planet.GetName]. The inhabitants seem intent on becoming a full-fledged spacefaring civilization. What they discover in the stars may prove too much for them to comprehend."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/93d760556454abd590b7.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"FASCINATING","label":{"zh":"很迷人。","en":"Fascinating."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"fircon.1505","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","delay":[{"days":"500"}],"source":"events/first_contact_dlc_events.txt:4318","story":"event-fircon-1495"}],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/first_contact_dlc_events.txt","line":4284},"sets":["physics_insights"],"names":{"pre_ftl_planet.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"}}},{"id":"fircon.1505","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"获得很多，但是失去的更多","en":"Much To Gain, Yet Much to Lose"},"texts":[{"zh":"现已证实，[event_target:pre_ftl_planet.GetName]确有一艘理论上存在超光速能力的飞船。他们已经开始进行测试，以期尽快突破光障。\n\n一旦成功，他们在技术上便已具备涉及星系外交的能力。这样的境遇必然对他们的社会造成或好或坏的深远影响。","en":"The existence of a theoretically FTL-capable craft on [event_target:pre_ftl_planet.GetName] is now confirmed. They have moved on to testing, hoping to soon break the light speed barrier.\n\nIf they are successful, they will technically be ready to engage in galactic diplomacy. Such an encounter is sure to have profound effects on their society, for good or ill."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/93d760556454abd590b7.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"fircon.1505.a","label":{"zh":"他们必须自力更生。保持距离进行观测。","en":"They must learn on their own. Observe from a distance."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"fircon.1510","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","delay":[{"days":"1000"}],"source":"events/first_contact_dlc_events.txt:4414","story":"event-fircon-1495"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"values_others","arg":"yes","scope":"","value":true}]]},{"key":"fircon.1505.b","label":{"zh":"他们还没准备好。破坏他们的任务。","en":"They're not ready. Sabotage their mission."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"fircon.1510","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","delay":[{"days":"1000"}],"source":"events/first_contact_dlc_events.txt:4439","story":"event-fircon-1495"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"values_others","arg":"no","scope":"","value":false}]]},{"key":"fircon.1505.c","label":{"zh":"改变我们的应对方案。帮助他们触及星辰！","en":"Change our approach. Help them reach the stars!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"fircon.1515","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","delay":[{"days":"1000"}],"source":"events/first_contact_dlc_events.txt:4464","story":"event-fircon-1495"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"values_others","arg":"yes","scope":"","value":true}]]},{"key":"fircon.1505.d","label":{"zh":"我们开始厌烦了。让他们在自己的道路上快马加鞭。","en":"We grow weary. Speed them along on their way."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"fircon.1515","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","delay":[{"days":"1000"}],"source":"events/first_contact_dlc_events.txt:4476","story":"event-fircon-1495"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"values_others","arg":"no","scope":"","value":false}]]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/first_contact_dlc_events.txt","line":4328},"sets":["physics_insights"],"names":{"event_target:pre_ftl_planet.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"}}},{"id":"fircon.1510","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"完全脱离","en":"Complete Separation"},"texts":[{"zh":"[pre_ftl_planet.GetName]上雄心勃勃的宇航员们试图突破光障。整个星球的目光都聚焦在这艘飞船向着星间启航。\n\n发射成功了。一切都按预期的参数运行中。随后他们启动了曲速引擎，事情发生了转折。\n\n他们成功地扭曲了时空连续统（这是一种迷人但存在缺陷的超光速航行方式），然而他们只在舰船尾部成功了。随之而来的在案超乎了[pre_ftl_planet.GetName]的一切想象。乘员们被剧烈地扭曲撕扯，身体的一部分停留于原地，而同时另一部分被扯入了未来。\n\n他们可得再多花一些时间才能进行下一次尝试了。","en":"The aspiring spacefarers on [pre_ftl_planet.GetName] attempted to break the light speed barrier. The whole world looked on as the spacecraft launched towards the stars.\n\nLiftoff was a success. Everything was operating within expected parameters. Then they engaged their warp drive and things took a turn.\n\nThey successfully distorted the shape of the space-time continuum (a fascinating but flawed approach to breaking the light speed barrier), however they were only successful in doing this in the aft section of the craft. The resulting carnage was beyond anything the inhabitants of [pre_ftl_planet.GetName] could have ever imagined. The crew was violently distorted, fixed in one part of space, whilst simultaneously having other parts of themselves stretched into the future.\n\nIt could be some time before they are ready for a second attempt."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/fc48a0abd497754a4ceb.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"fircon.1510.a","label":{"zh":"要是我们早点警告他们，他们现在早就成为太空文明了……","en":"Had we warned them, they would be spacefarers now..."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"他们的科技退步了，结果让他们倒车回到了前一个发展阶段。","en":"Their technology has regressed, effectively knocking them back to an earlier age in their development."}],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"situations:pre_ftl_tech_progress_situation","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"common/scripted_effects/pre_ftl_scripted_effects.txt:9","story":"pre-ftl-ages"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"values_others","arg":"yes","scope":"","value":true}]]},{"key":"fircon.1510.b","label":{"zh":"如期而至。他们的失败是不可避免的。","en":"As expected. Their failure was inevitable."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"他们的科技退步了，结果让他们倒车回到了前一个发展阶段。","en":"Their technology has regressed, effectively knocking them back to an earlier age in their development."}],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"situations:pre_ftl_tech_progress_situation","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"common/scripted_effects/pre_ftl_scripted_effects.txt:9","story":"pre-ftl-ages"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"values_others","arg":"no","scope":"","value":false}]]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/first_contact_dlc_events.txt","line":4482},"names":{"pre_ftl_planet.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"}}},{"id":"fircon.1515","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"步入太空文明","en":"Spacefaring Commences"},"texts":[{"zh":"[pre_ftl_planet.GetName]的人们在实验性跃迁引擎方面取得了巨大的成功，然而他们在关于时空扭曲产生器的投射距离计算方面犯了严重的错误。通过与他们的直接沟通，我们得以引导他们通过超空间航道这种广为接受的方式来进行超光速航行。\n\n依照我们的建议，[pre_ftl_planet.GetName]很快就能加入我们的星系社会了。","en":"The people of [pre_ftl_planet.GetName] have made remarkable progress on their experimental jump drive, however there were some glaring mistakes in their calculations relating to the projected range of their space-time distortion generator. By engaging in direct communication, we were able to guide them towards the accepted method of faster than light travel via hyperlane network.\n\nFollowing our advice, [pre_ftl_planet.GetName] will soon join us as a galactic spacefaring society."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/93d760556454abd590b7.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"fircon.1515.a","label":{"zh":"我们静候他们的到达，加入更广泛的星海共同体。","en":"We await their arrival into the wider galactic community."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"fircon.1520","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","delay":[{"days":"1000"}],"source":"events/first_contact_dlc_events.txt:4563","story":"event-fircon-1495"}],"terminal":false,"sets":["no_good_deed_achievement"]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/first_contact_dlc_events.txt","line":4539},"sets":["physics_insights"],"names":{"pre_ftl_planet.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"}}},{"id":"fircon.1520","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"在身边","en":"Among Us"},"texts":[{"zh":"[pre_ftl_planet.GetName]上的居民们作为一个宇航文明加入了星海共同体。\n\n我们的观测任务结束了，他们已经拥有了超光速运行能力。","en":"The inhabitants of [pre_ftl_planet.GetName] have joined the wider galactic community as a spacefaring society!\n\nOur observation mission now concludes, as they are now FTL capable."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/29a9136fa0fb22650607.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"fircon.1520.a","label":{"zh":"欢迎来到星海大家庭。","en":"Welcome to the galaxy."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"[pre_ftl_country.GetName]会挺进到下一个科技等级。","en":"[pre_ftl_country.GetName] will advance to their next technological age."}],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"event_chains:cybernetic_creed_chain","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c7645","when":[[[{"type":"flag","scope":"star","name":"nomad_settling_in_progress","path":"capital_scope/solar_system","value":false}]],[[{"type":"other","key":"is_planet_class","arg":"pc_habitat","scope":"","value":false}]],[[{"type":"other","key":"","arg":"owner","scope":"","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"has_origin","arg":"origin_cybernetic_creed","scope":"?","value":true,"label":{"zh":"义体信条","en":"Cybernetic Creed"}}]]],"source":"common/scripted_effects/01_start_of_game_effects.txt:916","story":"chain-cybernetic-creed-chain"},{"target":"preftl.1111","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c7645","delay":[{"days":"1"}],"when":[[[{"type":"flag","scope":"star","name":"nomad_settling_in_progress","path":"capital_scope/solar_system","value":false}]]],"source":"common/scripted_effects/pre_ftl_scripted_effects.txt:280","story":"pre-ftl-ages"},{"target":"machine_age.2150","kind":"option","cond